{
  "schema": "rcos-capability-contract/1",
  "capability_id": "qr-camo-embed",
  "notes": [
    "Declared invocation for the qr-camo-embed capability. The adapter executes the",
    "frozen blend script make_header_v2.py (the exact bytes eval-6 shipped, pinned by",
    "sha256 in the observation) once per case in its own scratch directory: it copies the",
    "case's cover to camo-src.png, runs the script with the case URL as argv[1] and the",
    "scratch dir as cwd (the script's SRC/OUT_PNG are cwd-relative by design), and records",
    "what the script did. The adapter never re-implements the blend, never decodes the QR",
    "itself, and never judges the output: every value in the observation is an argv, one of",
    "the script's own output streams, or a hash/header of a file the script read or wrote.",
    "",
    "Exit-code semantics of the ADAPTER (not the script): 0 = ran and wrote the",
    "observation; 4 = could not run (missing kernel env, malformed input, duplicate case",
    "names, unreadable source file, or no usable interpreter — see below). The SCRIPT's",
    "documented exit codes are 0 (embedded and every stress decode passed) and 1, which",
    "covers BOTH its documented refusals (the exact stderr line 'payload too long: ...' or",
    "'no contrast level survived the stress ladder — payload or cover unusable') AND any",
    "uncaught Python error (traceback). The adapter records outcome=refused for script exit",
    "1 without pre-judging which kind it was: the raw stdout and stderr are recorded and",
    "the gates tell the two apart by their exact lines.",
    "",
    "Interpreter resolution, in order: $RCOS_QR_PYTHON if set, else",
    "evidence/qr-venv/bin/python under RCOS_HOME. The interpreter and its dependency",
    "versions are recorded in the observation. The interpreter is ENVIRONMENT, not",
    "committed capability bytes: cv2/numpy/PIL resolve through the interpreter's normal",
    "site resolution (which follows the process environment), so the adapter inherits its",
    "environment unchanged and never embeds absolute user paths. A missing interpreter or",
    "failing dependency probe is cannotRun (exit 4), never a fabricated case record.",
    "",
    "The ~35-char practical payload limit is a property of the placement window at",
    "MODULE=11 with ERROR_CORRECT_H, not of this contract: the contract accepts URLs up to",
    "120 chars so the refusal path itself is exercisable (see the overflow case in the",
    "grounding eval). Covers outside the mid-tone photographic/textured band the README",
    "documents are likewise accepted by this contract and embedded by the script; whether",
    "the result is acceptable is the capability's llm gate's call, recorded in the registry",
    "history, not re-decided here."
  ],
  "input": {
    "type": "object",
    "required": ["cases"],
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "properties": {
      "cases": {
        "type": "array",
        "minItems": 1,
        "maxItems": 32,
        "items": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": ["name", "operation", "source", "url"],
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "name": { "type": "string", "pattern": "^[a-z0-9_]+$", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 40 },
            "operation": { "type": "string", "enum": ["embed"] },
            "source": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 1024 },
            "url": { "type": "string", "pattern": "^https?://[!-~]+$", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 120 }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "output": {
    "type": "object",
    "required": ["schema", "frozen", "cases"],
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "properties": {
      "schema": { "type": "string", "enum": ["qr-camo-embed-observation/1"] },
      "frozen": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["script", "interpreter"],
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "script": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": ["path", "sha256", "usage", "documented_exit_codes"],
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "properties": {
              "path": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 1024 },
              "sha256": { "type": "string", "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$" },
              "usage": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 2048 },
              "documented_exit_codes": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0, "maximum": 255 }
              }
            }
          },
          "interpreter": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": ["path", "version", "deps"],
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "properties": {
              "path": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 1024 },
              "version": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 64 },
              "deps": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": ["cv2", "qrcode", "zxingcpp", "numpy", "pillow"],
                "additionalProperties": false,
                "properties": {
                  "cv2": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 64 },
                  "qrcode": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 64 },
                  "zxingcpp": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 64 },
                  "numpy": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 64 },
                  "pillow": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 64 }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "cases": {
        "type": "array",
        "minItems": 1,
        "maxItems": 32,
        "items": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": ["name", "operation", "source", "url", "argv", "interpreter_path", "exit_status", "signal", "outcome", "duration_ms", "stdout", "stderr", "out_files"],
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "name": { "type": "string", "pattern": "^[a-z0-9_]+$", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 40 },
            "operation": { "type": "string", "enum": ["embed"] },
            "source": {
              "type": "object",
              "required": ["path", "sha256", "bytes", "png"],
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "properties": {
                "path": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 1024 },
                "sha256": { "type": "string", "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$" },
                "bytes": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 },
                "png": {
                  "type": ["object", "null"],
                  "required": ["width", "height", "bit_depth", "color_type"],
                  "additionalProperties": false,
                  "properties": {
                    "width": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1 },
                    "height": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1 },
                    "bit_depth": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1, "maximum": 16 },
                    "color_type": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0, "maximum": 6 }
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "url": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 120 },
            "argv": { "type": "array", "items": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 1024 }, "minItems": 1, "maxItems": 8 },
            "interpreter_path": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 1024 },
            "exit_status": { "type": ["integer", "null"], "minimum": 0, "maximum": 255 },
            "signal": { "type": ["string", "null"], "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 32 },
            "outcome": { "type": "string", "enum": ["embedded", "refused", "timed_out", "errored"] },
            "duration_ms": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 },
            "stdout": { "type": "string", "maxLength": 20000 },
            "stderr": { "type": "string", "maxLength": 20000 },
            "out_files": {
              "type": "array",
              "minItems": 0,
              "maxItems": 4,
              "items": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": ["path", "sha256", "bytes", "png"],
                "additionalProperties": false,
                "properties": {
                  "path": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 1024 },
                  "sha256": { "type": "string", "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$" },
                  "bytes": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 },
                  "png": {
                    "type": ["object", "null"],
                    "required": ["width", "height", "bit_depth", "color_type"],
                    "additionalProperties": false,
                    "properties": {
                      "width": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1 },
                      "height": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1 },
                      "bit_depth": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1, "maximum": 16 },
                      "color_type": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0, "maximum": 6 }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
